# Mount Hyjal - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes whose source is physically in Mount Hyjal (zone 2482),
# verified against the local Forever game data: 78 vendor-sold (6 from Pexmit,
# 72 from Aisarra Nightmeadow) and 2 dropped narrowly by in-zone mobs (see
# docs/mount-hyjal-companions-inventory.md). Profession labels follow name
# convention (Plans=Blacksmithing, Pattern=Leatherworking except the
# cloth-named Tailoring sets, Schematic=Engineering, Manual/Alchemy
# recipe=Alchemy); the data carries no profession flag. Each step is gated to
# its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Every buy line carries an
# npc pin to its in-zone vendor. No stock-class flag exists in the data, so
# nothing is marked limited. Cooking, Fishing, First Aid, Enchanting, Mining,
# Herbalism and Skinning have no in-zone source and say so below instead of
# padding. This guide never accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/mount-hyjal-recipes
title Mount Hyjal - Recipes & Patterns
levels 54-60
zone Mount Hyjal
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords mount hyjal, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Blacksmithing - Pexmit's stock

  zone map 2482

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  vendor 266901 -- Pexmit (45.74, 82.52)
  buy 251468 "Plans: Bold Dirk" npc 266901
  note Pexmit also roams the northern front (48.22, 33.77) and (48.81, 34.11); he is a rare too - see the rares companion. Buy first, hunt after.

