step Blacksmithing - wormwing drop

  zone map 2482

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  collect 251446 "Plans: Blessed Plate Chest" optional
  note Drops narrowly from the wormwing harpies, windwitches, ambushers and Zarrat Wormwing on the (44-56, 53-63) grounds - four droppers total in the data. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Alchemy - demon grounds drop

  zone map 2482

  when skill Alchemy 1

  collect 284871 "Recipe: Transmute Legionite" optional
  note Drops narrowly from Felguard Sentinels around (43.89, 32.63) and Mazzogore the Weak around (50.68, 37.77) - two droppers total in the data, both core-guide kills, so check bags after the core route. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step No in-zone source - Cooking, Fishing, First Aid, Enchanting, Mining, Herbalism, Skinning

  zone map 2482

  note Cooking, Fishing, First Aid, Enchanting, Mining, Herbalism and Skinning have no recipe source physically in Mount Hyjal in the data - trainer staples and out-of-zone vendors are out of scope for this companion.
